1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,908
Two more cultures appear in the syllabus, though neither is practised in Nepal.

2
00:00:04,908 --> 00:00:13,450
Pearls form when a pearl sac in an oyster's mantle secretes nacre around a graft; culture was pioneered by Mikimoto.

3
00:00:13,450 --> 00:00:22,552
And lac is a resin secreted by the female lac insect, Kerria lacca, on trees like kusum, ber and palas.

